   "node_type": "section",
   "text": "\\section{Why eviction is needed}\nThe cache grows with every token and with every concurrent request, while accelerator memory is fixed.\nWhen memory runs out a server must evict cached tokens and later recompute them if they are needed again.\nEvicting a whole unit, such as one section of a document, frees exactly that unit's share of the formula above.\n\n\\end{document}\n",
